この雨は当分この状態が続くでしょう。</Text></Property></Kind><BasinTable><BasinTableTH><ForecastTH><StartTime significant="yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm">2025-05-26T09:20</StartTime><EndTime significant="yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm">2025-05-26T11:20</EndTime></ForecastTH><ObservationTH><StartTime significant="yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm">2025-05-26T03:20</StartTime><EndTime significant="yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm">2025-05-26T09:20</EndTime></ObservationTH></BasinTableTH><BasinData><BasinName>境川・逢妻川流域</BasinName><Forecast unit="ミリ" type="流域平均雨量" condition="正常">20</Forecast><Observation unit="ミリ" type="流域平均雨量" condition="正常">80</Observation></BasinData></BasinTable></Item></MeteorologicalInfo></MeteorologicalInfos><MeteorologicalInfos type="水位情報"><MeteorologicalInfo><DateTime significant="yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm">2025-05-26T09:30</DateTime><Item><Kind><Property><Type>水位</Type><Text>愛知県境川水系　境川・逢妻川の水位観測所における水位は次の通りと見込まれます。</Text></Property><ImageData><Title/><ImageName/></ImageData></Kind></Item></MeteorologicalInfo><TimeSeriesInfo><TimeDefine timeId="1"><DateTime significant="yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm">2025-05-26T09:30</DateTime><Duration>PT60M</Duration><Name>現況</Name></TimeDefine><TimeDefine timeId="2"><DateTime significant="yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm">2025-05-26T10:30</DateTime><Duration>PT60M</Duration><Name>１時間後</Name></TimeDefine><TimeDefine timeId="3"><DateTime significant="yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm">2025-05-26T11:30</DateTime><Duration>PT60M</Duration><Name>２時間後</Name></TimeDefine><TimeDefine timeId="4"><DateTime significant="yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm">2025-05-26T12:30</DateTime><Duration>PT60M</Duration><Name>３時間後</Name></TimeDefine><TimeDefine timeId="5"><DateTime significant="yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm">2025-05-26T13:30</DateTime><Duration>PT60M</Duration><Name>４時間後</Name></TimeDefine><TimeDefine timeId="6"><DateTime significant="yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm">2025-05-26T14:30</DateTime><Duration>PT60M</Duration><Name>５時間後</Name></TimeDefine><TimeDefine timeId="7"><DateTime significant="yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm">2025-05-26T15:30</DateTime><Duration>PT60M</Duration><Name>６時間後</Name></TimeDefine